<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus December CPI increases 0.14 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Cyprus December CPI increases 0.14 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus' consumer price index increased 0.14 percent to 118.07 points in December from 117.90 in November, the island's statistics and research department announced.</p>
<p>    Consumer price index	    Dec 96    Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	0.14	0.05     -0.06</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)	  2.51	2.29     1.64</p>
<p>    Index (1992=100)		  118.07    117.90   115.18</p>
<p>The price of fuel and meats rose, while potatoes and fresh fruits and vegetables were cheaper, the department said.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
